  "ruleText": "Plc 1508.04 Documentation Required for Renewal Application. In addition to the information and documentation required by Plc 308.07, the applicant shall submit documentation of current NBRC credential(s).\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Plc 1500) #13496, INTERIM, eff 11-27-22; ss by #13621, eff 5-22-23 (formerly Plc 1508.05) (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Plc 1500)",
